Homepage: https://github.com/ceph/rados-java
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: librados-java
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, default-jre-headless (>= 2:1.17) | java17-runtime-headless, librados2 (>= 14.2), librbd1 (>= 14.2), libradosstriper1 (>= 14.2)
Description: Java JNA bindings for librados, librbd and libradosstriper
 Java bindings for the Ceph RADOS object store client library (librados),
 the RADOS block device library (librbd) and libradosstriper, implemented
 with JNA so no native build against the Ceph headers is required.
